{title: Welcome everybody}
{x_theme: praise}
{x_source: docx:1. Incomplete/Welcome everybody.docx}

{comment: Chorus}
Welcome everybody, come right in
Stand up and let’s begin to praise the Lord.
Praise the Lord.
For He’s worthy to be praised and adored.
Let’s praise the Lord.

{comment: Chorus 2}
Hallelujah give Him highest praise.
Exalt, extol, and lift up His name
And praise the Lord.
Let’s praise the Lord.
For He’s worthy to be praised and adored.
Let’s praise the Lord.
